# Every text file in this tree is UTF-8 with LF newlines, on every platform that clones
# it. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the default on Windows) rewrites every line
# ending on checkout, and the provenance digests -- sha256 over `read_bytes()` -- fail
# for files whose content is unchanged in every way the repository means: 19 rows read
# as "whose bytes are not the ones recorded" on a checkout that is byte-for-byte the
# recorded one after normalisation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts keep their bytes untouched.
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
